Date: Tue, 31 Mar 2026 19:45:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] configuration: add AnalogValve D-Bus interface

Add D-Bus interface definitions for analog valve configuration used in
liquid cooling systems. This includes:

- AnalogValve: main interface with properties for valve name, type,
  max flow rate, setpoint voltage range, tolerance, and open threshold.
- SetPointDAC: sub-interface for DAC device configuration with I2C
  bus/address, channel index, offset, and scale factor.
- FeedbackADC: sub-interface for ADC device configuration used for
  valve position feedback with channel index and scale factor.

Also add the corresponding generated meson build files.

Reference:
https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/88760
https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/88761

Change-Id: I9f27ce1f238c05faf05d075e34525b2b0d847674
Signed-off-by: Jagpal Singh Gill <paligill@gmail.com>
